Version 1.4 adds opt-in native Microsoft SQL Server bulk loading to the
FreeTDS driver through the CT-Library BCP API.  The implementation provides
bounded mutation-stream events, exact serialized-payload byte accounting,
automatic fallback for ineligible tables, and savepoint-based abort cleanup
without committing the caller's transaction.

For complete release notes and restrictions, see the Doxygen-generated HTML
documentation in docs/sybase/html/index.html or at
https://qoretechnologies.github.io/module-sybase/.
